---
const products = [
  { name: 'Chandan', img: '/assets/arisva/chandan.jpg' },
  { name: 'Ashtgandh', img: '/assets/arisva/ashtgandh.jpg' },
  { name: 'Patchouli', img: '/assets/arisva/patchouli.jpg' },
  { name: 'Hawan', img: '/assets/arisva/hawan.jpg' },
  { name: 'Guggal', img: '/assets/arisva/guggal.jpg' },
  { name: 'Oudh', img: '/assets/arisva/oudh.jpg' },
  { name: 'Kastoor', img: '/assets/arisva/kastoor.jpg' },
  { name: 'Mogra', img: '/assets/arisva/mogra.jpg' },
];

const stats = [
  { value: '3.5', suffix: 'L', prefix: '₹', label: 'Peak monthly revenue' },
  { value: '28', suffix: '%', prefix: '', label: 'CAC reduction' },
  { value: '2.8', suffix: 'x', prefix: '', label: 'ROAS maintained' },
  { value: '69', suffix: '%', prefix: '', label: 'CVR improvement' },
];
---
<section class="section arisva" id="arisva">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label reveal">Chapter: Arisva</span>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal stagger-1">The brand I built<br/>and shut down</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle reveal stagger-2">
      A D2C bambooless incense brand. Eight fragrances, modern packaging,
      everything built solo — from product design to Meta ads to customer support.
      It had traction. It didn't have a sustainable model.
    </p>
    <div class="divider reveal stagger-3"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="arisva-gallery">
    <div class="gallery-track">
      {products.map((p, i) => (
        <div class={`gallery-item reveal stagger-${(i % 6) + 1}`}>
          <img src={p.img} alt={`Arisva ${p.name}`} loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="arisva-stats reveal">
      {stats.map(s => (
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-value" data-count={s.value.includes('.') ? undefined : s.value} data-suffix={s.suffix} data-prefix={s.prefix}>
            {s.prefix}{s.value}{s.suffix}
          </span>
          <span class="stat-label">{s.label}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="arisva-narrative reveal">
      <div class="narrative-block">
        <h3>What worked</h3>
        <p>The brand resonated. Conversion rates climbed from 1.6% to 2.7%.
           Repeat purchase rate grew 22%. Customers came back for Chandan and Mogra.
           The packaging stood on shelves against brands 10x its size.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="narrative-block">
        <h3>What didn't</h3>
        <p>The business was built on paid acquisition with ~150 organic followers.
           Every customer had a cost. At ₹3.5L monthly revenue, margins were thin
           and scaling meant spending more — not compounding. Traction isn't a business model.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="narrative-block">
        <h3>What it taught me</h3>
        <p>That building a brand is craft. That unit economics don't lie.
           That a solo founder wearing every hat eventually drops one.
           And that the best time to start the next thing is when you've been honest about the last.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="arisva-coda reveal">
      <em>Arisva taught me that traction isn't a business model. <span class="gold">Yovance was built on that lesson.</span></em>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .arisva { background: var(--bg-deep); }
  .arisva-gallery {
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 40px 0;
  }
  .gallery-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 0 var(--gutter);
    width: max-content;
  }
  .gallery-item {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 200px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .gallery-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
  }
  .gallery-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .arisva-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 40px 0 60px;
  }
  .stat-card {
    padding: 28px 24px;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .stat-card:hover { border-color: var(--border-accent); }
  .stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .arisva-narrative {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .narrative-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .narrative-block p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .arisva-coda {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .arisva-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .arisva-narrative { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .gallery-item { width: 160px; }
  }
</style>
